  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECOWAS IDF GRANT FOR IMPLEMENTATION OF AIR TR. AGENDA IN WCA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the IDF grant is two fold: 1)strengthen the institutional capacity of ECOWAS   to cope with the challenges of implementing air transport reform agenda; and 2) build a consensus on the action plan on how to achieve the full liberalization of the domestic and regional market within a two year period.</narrative>
  </description>
